WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.860
Two hundred years ago,
comets were dropped on Mars.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.310
That's how we got water.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.723
My great-grandparents called it “rain”.

00:00:08.762 --> 00:00:10.661
Once in all of history.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:14.723
Outside, only in a helmet.

00:00:14.762 --> 00:00:18.244
All the water is in the river,
salty and poisonous.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.835
Only the corporation purifies it.

00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:23.680
And only with a permit.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.498
This is Typhonia, my home.

00:00:27.538 --> 00:00:29.449
We were never given permits.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:32.862
LETHE guards the canyon.

00:00:32.902 --> 00:00:37.200
Without malice, it shoots down
anything that flies without a permit.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:38.972
But there are pilots.

00:00:39.013 --> 00:00:41.323
They bring water to those
who were denied it.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.060
This is Ivo Sarka.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.585
His watch has stopped.

00:00:46.625 --> 00:00:47.884
I don't ask.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.685
Every run he makes is our water.

00:00:51.725 --> 00:00:53.519
And I wait by the radio.
